{"skill":{"slug":"api-gateway","displayName":"API Gateway"},"version":{"version":"1.2.29","createdAt":1790970481328,"changelog":"- Improved documentation for connecting and managing third-party apps via Maton, including new examples and guidance on connection listing, creation, and selection.\n- Clarified consent requirements and security practices for creating connections and executing sensitive actions.\n- Added detailed usage explanations for app-specific and raw API gateway calls, including connection selection and response handling.\n- Expanded instructions and security notes for using Maton's function execution features, with emphasis on identity, privilege, and network policy.\n- Updated installation and authentication instructions for the Maton CLI.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":58162,"sha256":"9e9a8f3a0403af88b1a03b375f4fb9c23ef0b0aff95dac9fb6016e4ffee13671","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/zoho-projects/README.md","size":13303,"sha256":"78e6cd4d9dcad47c0d6465e15176aeaf5959717a38b263ed2d2e72f502fa5a73","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/outlook/README.md","size":10487,"sha256":"6d351f0f737818046a82fc8e05a9b94bdd8936739d048dccf3083205ecb5824f","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/youtube-analytics/README.md","size":8366,"sha256":"558d79802105c1d09b3e196ddd8ab5d68c2a1717d199003ad7ef42051afbd8d7","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/fastmail/README.md","size":34864,"sha256":"b4dea302cfd65553924ed4ec8fc9a9d77f1945443e1903fa88079d40d2717bbc","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/buffer/README.md","size":14195,"sha256":"dee652d81906a27252e490cb6bff8b41d58f2688189e1ce1e9e0bf1f7c91f6ec","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion-mcp/README.md","size":15241,"sha256":"9d0531a04118154d01fe1961f2d0b1d42d1363928fa83d6d0e9bec049da16bd4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion-mcp/schemas/notion-search.json","size":48